    "long_instructions": "# Investigate\r\n\r\nRun the code again and look at the output.\r\n\r\n**Trace it:** Before Check 2 runs, where is the Painter? Is the square ahead of it open? Finish the comment on Check 2 with your answer.\r\n\r\n**Tinker:** Delete one of the `move()` lines in the setup and run the code again. What changed in the output? Why did it change? Then put the `move()` back.\r\n\r\n**Tinker:** Add a third copy of the Check 1 block at the end of the program. Run the code again. Did anything change? Then delete the extra copy.\r\n\r\n**Comment it:** Finish the comment on Check 1. Name the `if` keyword, the condition, and the indented block, and say when the block runs.",
